        "Description": "Good morning 47,\rYour targets are known from TV media as lower class married in the famies. With their connections, they aquire new identitie, marry into the family of one of the England&apos;s aristocrats, scene an accidents and aquire their legacy. In total, royal sercet agency has informed us over 5 cases of family wipeouts. Their next targets are the Carlisles.\r\rWe need to put end to this madness. Eliminate your targets with their private security detail ASAP.\r\rGood luck.",
